  "description": "PolyPrompt is a lightweight, unified .NET library for chat, tool calling, image, audio, and video input, transcription, text generation, embeddings, reranking, classification, decision models, and model catalogs, with one client per provider: OpenAI (Responses API), OpenAI-compatible servers (vLLM, Ollama /v1, LM Studio, gateways), Azure OpenAI, xAI Grok, Anthropic Claude, Google Gemini, Google Vertex AI, AWS Bedrock, Ollama, Ollama Cloud, Cohere, VoyageAI, Hugging Face Text Embeddings Inference (TEI), and TypeSafe (Jev, Ollaya). Every client exposes every operation; unsupported ones throw CapabilityNotSupportedException, and client.Supports checks first. It also drives local agent harnesses (Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, Cursor CLI, Mux, Pi, and OpenCode) as shell-free child processes with streamed agent events, session resume, bounded output, timeouts, and process-tree cancellation. Native AOT compatible.",
