  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "5.0.0: images, audio, and video input on chat (ContentPart, ImageInput, AudioInput, VideoInput), TranscribeAsync, and Gemini and OpenAI file uploads. Breaking: ToolChatAsync merges into ChatAsync, and ChatMessage.Content is a list of parts (use Text for plain text). Text-only requests are unchanged on the wire. See MIGRATION_V4_TO_V5.md, MULTIMEDIA.md, and CHANGELOG.md at https://github.com/jchristn/PolyPrompt.",
